1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,244
Welcome to the last lesson of Module 10!

2
00:00:03,244 --> 00:00:06,536
So far, your AI agents
have talked to customers.

3
00:00:06,536 --> 00:00:11,337
Now, we'll put AI inside your
automations, so every message is sorted,

4
00:00:11,337 --> 00:00:15,041
summarised and answered,
without you lifting a finger.

5
00:00:15,889 --> 00:00:20,523
In AI Agents, on the Getting Started
tab, you'll find Workflow AI.

6
00:00:20,523 --> 00:00:24,596
It adds AI steps to the workflows
you build in Automation.

7
00:00:24,596 --> 00:00:29,160
Think of it as a smart assistant
sitting inside every automation.

8
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:31,477
Click Open to see what it can do.

9
00:00:32,328 --> 00:00:34,659
There are a few AI actions to know.

10
00:00:34,659 --> 00:00:38,654
Classify message sorts a message
into categories you choose,

11
00:00:38,654 --> 00:00:42,384
like a booking request, a
price question or a complaint.

12
00:00:42,384 --> 00:00:45,314
You choose the categories,
in plain English.

13
00:00:45,314 --> 00:00:49,842
Summarise turns a long conversation
into a short note for your team.

14
00:00:50,694 --> 00:00:55,002
AI reply writes and sends an
answer using your knowledge base,

15
00:00:55,002 --> 00:00:58,199
or hands the chat to
your Conversation AI bot.

16
00:00:58,199 --> 00:01:03,063
And Sentiment tells you if a message
is positive, neutral or negative.

17
00:01:03,915 --> 00:01:08,836
In the workflow builder, click Add
action, and look in the AI section.

18
00:01:08,836 --> 00:01:13,054
Each AI step saves its result,
so the next steps can use it,

19
00:01:13,054 --> 00:01:16,358
and each one is a single
Workflow AI execution.

20
00:01:16,358 --> 00:01:19,663
AI steps in workflows
are part of the Pro plan.

21
00:01:20,512 --> 00:01:23,268
Here's a real example: AI inbox triage.

22
00:01:23,268 --> 00:01:26,872
When a customer replies,
AI classifies the message,

23
00:01:26,872 --> 00:01:29,487
and saves a summary to their contact.

24
00:01:29,487 --> 00:01:33,162
Then an If/Else step sends
it down the right branch.

25
00:01:34,012 --> 00:01:34,939
Let's test it.

26
00:01:34,939 --> 00:01:37,589
Grace asks to book a check-up next week.

27
00:01:37,589 --> 00:01:40,570
Click Run test, and
watch each step light up.

28
00:01:40,570 --> 00:01:44,412
AI labels it a booking request,
writes a one-line summary,

29
00:01:44,412 --> 00:01:46,863
and replies with two available times.

30
00:01:47,712 --> 00:01:50,521
Now a price question about whitening.

31
00:01:50,521 --> 00:01:53,786
This time, it goes down
the pricing branch,

32
00:01:53,786 --> 00:01:58,570
and the AI answers from your
knowledge base: whitening is £199,

33
00:01:58,570 --> 00:02:00,847
and gentle on sensitive teeth.

34
00:02:01,697 --> 00:02:02,757
And a complaint?

35
00:02:02,757 --> 00:02:05,009
AI spots it, but it doesn't reply.

36
00:02:05,009 --> 00:02:10,506
Instead, the workflow assigns it to Sarah
with a note, so a real person handles it,

37
00:02:10,506 --> 00:02:12,757
just as a good receptionist would.

38
00:02:12,757 --> 00:02:16,069
Unhappy customers should
always hear from a human.

39
00:02:16,928 --> 00:02:18,788
It works the other way, too.

40
00:02:18,788 --> 00:02:23,173
In Conversation AI, a bot can
trigger a workflow mid-conversation.

41
00:02:23,173 --> 00:02:27,957
Open the bot's Actions, click Add
action, and choose Trigger a workflow.

42
00:02:27,957 --> 00:02:31,013
For example, to start
your new lead follow-up.

43
00:02:31,864 --> 00:02:32,987
Here's a pro tip.

44
00:02:32,987 --> 00:02:38,339
In every AI workflow, add a branch for
complaints or negative sentiment that goes

45
00:02:38,339 --> 00:02:39,463
to a real person.

46
00:02:39,463 --> 00:02:43,361
And test with your own real
messages before you publish it.

47
00:02:43,361 --> 00:02:47,524
Start with one simple workflow,
like summarising new enquiries,

48
00:02:47,524 --> 00:02:48,911
and build from there.

49
00:02:49,761 --> 00:02:51,529
That's Module 10 complete!

50
00:02:51,529 --> 00:02:54,182
You've met every AI employee in Kyntlo.

51
00:02:54,182 --> 00:02:57,786
Next, in Module 11, we'll
look after your reputation,

52
00:02:57,786 --> 00:03:01,322
starting by connecting your
Google Business Profile.

53
00:03:01,322 --> 00:03:02,274
See you there.
